  "detailed_description": "The scheme &amp;quot;Mahila Bakri Palan&amp;quot; was introduced by the Department of Animal Husbandry, Government of Uttarakhand. The scheme aims to empower women, especially abandoned, widowed, destitute, single, and disaster-affected women, by providing them support for goat rearing to generate livelihood and improve household income.\n<br>\n\n",
  "eligibility": "\n1. The applicant must be a resident of Uttarakhand.\n1. The applicant must be a woman.\n1. The applicant must be from one of the following categories:\n\n\n- Abandoned\n- Widow\n- Destitute\n- Single woman\n- Disaster-affected woman\n\n<br>\n\n",
  "exclusions": "<br>\n\n",
